    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The forum will serve as a platform to advocate for these legislative changes, showcasing successful examples and engaging stakeholders in discussions on fostering a creative, innovative, circular and green economy. By bringing together key players, the forum will build momentum for implementing the recommended legislative reforms on crea-tive and innovative economy and discuss the prospects for the circular economy in Turkmenistan.</narrative>
